63d637d0b330c982", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b2c97ea/uploads/origins/5f6552f7-3f75-4051-b0ca-6caef12dc603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4320e5b1688d20563d637d0b330c982, https://si.imgix.net/1b2c97ea/uploads/origins/5f6552f7-3f75-4051-b0ca-6caef12dc603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98d69e0775ef07486c34028d70647cb2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b2c97ea/uploads/origins/5f6552f7-3f75-4051-b0ca-6caef12dc603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a44ee6321b569ddcf7e8f69dfb2ff45 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really love your illustration. The illustration last time was really  really great,  really really cute. Thank you very much! If you can, I hope you can draw illustration of my OC Duolc.\nReference link: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/21oepj6e9mx\n\nI hope you can illustrate my OC. My OC Duolc is a young boy who can use cloud magic, living in a fantasy land. The link contains his outfits from different periods (空島時代、魔法学院時代、酒場の手伝い時代、郵便配達人時代), and his personality varies as well (you can refer to the description in the album). You can choose the outfit design of Duolc you want to draw as an illustration, or draw his story based on your inspiration.\nI hope you can accept my request. It doesn't matter if you feel inappropriate, you can cancel this request.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mo_otsss/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3915570, "client_id": 261077, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c700335847e1ec178596ba8ec41ef7d2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c700335847e1ec178596ba8ec41ef7d2, https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c72094a3b8939cee4383a90b6ea55427 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fa9e435217d1579261a1706cd5d374c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a9b18747833999ced70f96aabd3ca64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a9b18747833999ced70f96aabd3ca64, https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6717b5eb3c525bbfb85b5ce16f48b8b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb49fb0e/uploads/origins/b01a5757-09df-4cc6-b3f6-2a476e885d97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e97a1fc5bd69861ad727351c2d3ea1f 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。るーんと申します。\nMOTSU.先生の描かれるパステルな色遣いの美麗な少年達に惹かれ、いつも陰ながら拝見させていただいており、この度skebをひらかれたとのことで、ぜひ当方のうちよそキャラクターを描いていただきたいと思い、リクエストいたしました。\n\n【参考URL】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OJaN-jZlwMqmzWQhfAcbLkgQKZiSHaCM\n\n【構図】 \n全てお任せいたします。\n\n【服装・髪型など】\nこちらに関して、MOTSU.先生のお任せでお願い出来ませんでしょうか？コーディネートやヘアアレンジなどお好きにしていただいて構いませんので、よろしければぜひキャラクターの新たなスタイルを考案して下さりますと幸いです…!!\n\n【これがあれば嬉しいな】\nMOTSU.先生が描かれる可愛らしい日常風景も、決めポーズがバッチリきまっているイラストも本当に大好き…なので、『デート中に撮ったプリクラ』風のイラストが…見たいな…と思っております。可能であればこちらのシチュエーションでお願いいたします🥲💖\nまた、MOTSU.先生のミニキャライラストも大好きなので、可能であればイラスト内に盛り込んでいただけるととても嬉しいです。\n\n【使用用途】\n・個人鑑賞/使用　・完全個人用に印刷\n（ぜひアクリルグッズとして印刷させて頂きたいので、各々PSDデータでの入稿が可能であればお願いいたします）\n\n大変お忙しいとは存じますが、ご検討頂けますと幸いです。\n金額に不備等ございましたら、再送して頂いて構いません。 何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mo_otsss/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3915570, "client_id": 667554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35cb9e72a2e6a6765366e2aca31df966", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35cb9e72a2e6a6765366e2aca31df966, https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54e7d56d7ee34c23b3f9bb689d12dddf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a49a8a4b0de577e5360d4c9547001384 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=909ee31ffffaca93e7fbd6cf7faecb44", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=909ee31ffffaca93e7fbd6cf7faecb44, https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fccd7ac4e123043ce71ccad28dd10f24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aad9c168/uploads/origins/0dd5d693-636f-4b31-8ee7-9dcdc12605e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa05bfc900121f742a48e43b6962efc3 3x"}, "body": "Hello MOTSUさん! I really love your illustration so I hope you can draw the illustration for my OCs (Little Blanke & little Side).\nReference link: https://sta.sh/225gurh6kmu7\n\n·Character\nBlanke (Kid Version) (145cm): He is 【silent and expressionless】, occasionally showing signs of being a child, like a cat who likes to rely on Side.\nSide (Kid Version) (150cm): He has a 【more mature mindset】 than his peers and is a type of person who enjoys taking responsibility on his own. He is reluctantly taking care of Blanke.\n\n·Request\nI hope you can draw my OCs illustration. I want to see them wearing sailor costumes (【4-Sailor costumes】 in the album).\n\nI hope you can accept my request. It doesn't matter if you feel inappropriate, you can cancel this request. Thank you!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@ebi_oishiiii/works/315", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1166238, "client_id": 3915570, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb427af3/uploads/origins/cb98a7a9-d417-44ed-8363-831c9c2fa5e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2078c780bbfcf9006a1a067eac3ca2b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb427af3/uploads/origins/cb98a7a9-d417-44ed-8363-831c9c2fa5e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2078c780bbfcf9006a1a067eac3ca2b, https://si.imgix.net/eb427af3/uploads/origins/cb98a7a9-d417-44ed-8363-831c9c2fa5e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53eb41a7b10af1b2c2e0743b0fd593c0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb427af3/uploads/origins/cb98a7a9-d417-44ed-8363-831c9c2fa5e9?bg=%2